This glazed Almond Blue[berry] Cake is perfect for many things![ The recipe] is easy to whip up,[ and the] cake is a fabulous addition to a brunch, or dished up as dessert at a summer party out on the patio[. Fresh] blue[berry] baked goods are my personal favorite on an early summer morning with a cup of coffee[.] I hope you enjoy,[ and] don't forget to pin this keeper[ for later!
]This[ sour cream] coffee[ cake] is an absolute win for[ entertaining]. This can absolutely[ impress] as a brunch item, or is a fabulous recipe to use around the holidays[.] This cake is extremely easy and can be dressed[ up] a little[ more with a fancy] bundt pan[.] It is so moist and flavorful[. The sour cream blends] in[ and] adds a savory side to compliment[ the sweet] just perfectly[!]
A fun variation of the traditional pancake:[ Vanilla] yogurt pancakes[ with] mini[ chocolate chips]! These pancakes are very dense and filling, while remaining fluffy and delicious.

