> Lock in a great price for Les[n]í pension – rated 8.2 by recent guests!
The owner come to pick us up with his car anf was so kind, the room was clean and the view at the morning was fabulous. Breakfast is ok , similar to all Czech Republic hotels/pension but satisfied.
Good location with a nice view from the terrace and very friendly staff.
